  _skillName: Magma Burst
  _description: 'Attack Pattern Directive Group 2 - Charge & Release ("Magma Burst"
    flavor, erupt pattern). Hold to charge, release at the right moment for a damage
    bonus. Scores TWO instants: press timing vs. the warning-hop tell, and release
    timing vs. the target hold duration. A perfect press + perfect release deals
    maximum damage; any passing combination deals a scaled damage range; a miss on
    EITHER instant cancels the attack for zero damage.'
